{"fps": 30, "duration": 69.36, "totalFrames": 2081, "lines": [{"text": "This is Jensen Huang, 33 years running Nvidia, same black leather jacket.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.78, "words": [{"w": "This", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.58}, {"w": "is", "s": 0.58, "e": 0.98}, {"w": "Jensen", "s": 0.98, "e": 1.42}, {"w": "Huang,", "s": 1.42, "e": 1.82}, {"w": "33", "s": 2.42, "e": 2.7}, {"w": "years", "s": 2.7, "e": 3.22}, {"w": "running", "s": 3.22, "e": 3.58}, {"w": "Nvidia,", "s": 3.58, "e": 3.88}, {"w": "same", "s": 4.36, "e": 4.6}, {"w": "black", "s": 4.6, "e": 5.1}, {"w": "leather", "s": 5.1, "e": 5.38}, {"w": "jacket.", "s": 5.38, "e": 5.78}], "id": 0, "startFrame": 0, "endFrame": 173}, {"text": "Then, in one week, he was gone.", "start": 6.52, "end": 9.08, "words": [{"w": "Then,", "s": 6.52, "e": 6.84}, {"w": "in", "s": 7.12, "e": 7.32}, {"w": "one", "s": 7.32, "e": 7.74}, {"w": "week,", "s": 7.74, "e": 8.08}, {"w": "he", "s": 8.44, "e": 8.48}, {"w": "was", "s": 8.48, "e": 8.64}, {"w": "gone.", "s": 8.64, "e": 9.08}], "id": 1, "startFrame": 196, "endFrame": 272}, {"text": "He quit after reports linked him to an alleged Chinese spy.", "start": 9.94, "end": 12.98, "words": [{"w": "He", "s": 9.94, "e": 10.1}, {"w": "quit", "s": 10.1, "e": 10.36}, {"w": "after", "s": 10.36, "e": 10.68}, {"w": "reports", "s": 10.68, "e": 11.12}, {"w": "linked", "s": 11.12, "e": 11.36}, {"w": "him", "s": 11.36, "e": 11.52}, {"w": "to", "s": 11.52, "e": 11.68}, {"w": "an", "s": 11.68, "e": 11.78}, {"w": "alleged", "s": 11.78, "e": 12.12}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 12.12, "e": 12.54}, {"w": "spy.", "s": 12.54, "e": 12.98}], "id": 2, "startFrame": 298, "endFrame": 389}, {"text": "He hasn't been charged.", "start": 13.52, "end": 14.66, "words": [{"w": "He", "s": 13.52, "e": 13.7}, {"w": "hasn't", "s": 13.7, "e": 14.2}, {"w": "been", "s": 14.2, "e": 14.36}, {"w": "charged.", "s": 14.36, "e": 14.66}], "id": 3, "startFrame": 406, "endFrame": 440}, {"text": "But here's the strange part.", "start": 15.46, "end": 16